      "current_tex": "\\begin{definition}[Closed-Set Family of a Topology]\\label{def:closed-set-family-of-topology}\nLet \\((X,\\tau)\\) be a topological space.  The \\emph{closed-set family}\nassociated to \\(\\tau\\) is\n\\[\n\\mathcal{F}_{\\tau}\n=\n\\{F\\subseteq X:X\\setminus F\\in\\tau\\}.\n\\]\n\\end{definition}",
